    "created_at": "2026-02-03T22:13:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-03T22:13:06Z",
    "body": "> Make either `= []` or `= {}` valid for `record<K, V>`.\n\nWe're interpreting this as we should pick one (mutually exclusive), and not add both. We're adding support for `= {}` as opposed to `= []`, since the latter doesn't seem to make as much sense. Hopefully we're interpreting this right.",
